{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1789401291000-82d771", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "电子发票重复报销怎么防？", "id": "9d652512fa3a4c748229c2fbb695fbf7", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:54:51", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "481574fb0f22484cbccf595595548bf8", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:54:51", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "08d92b1660254e1fae3d84fb26906784", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:54:59", "finished_at": "2026-09-14T15:55:41"}, {"type": "text", "text": "三个手段：\n1. OA 报销单加「发票号码」必填字段，保存时自动查重（历史库比对）；\n2. 每月财务用国家税务总局查验平台抽验 10%；\n3. 建立全司发票号码库，已报销的号码永久占用。\n发现重复按制度追回并计入诚信档案。", "id": "7c2d971e52dd49a0ba622a544c840d94", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:54:59", "finished_at": "2026-09-14T15:55:41"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "56ac604a54e241aa95a4d1c7ea728130", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:54:59", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-14T15:55:41", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "这个有没有模板可以参考？", "id": "9c74f5eddf6a4222847e8fb860130608", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:57:41", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "28be7ae6bffd4bfdb68ff4549a8c0951", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:57:41", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "9872f4d991c34646a7a1ad69befe13f8", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:57:47", "finished_at": "2026-09-14T15:58:16"}, {"type": "text", "text": "有的，标准模板已在平台资料库，直接取用即可；如需按部门微调字段，告诉我具体岗位我来出一版定制表。", "id": "da443327ed604fdd9dcab08daf0c720f", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:57:47", "finished_at": "2026-09-14T15:58:16"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "84ce9b67a7314347826c67e638669313", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:57:47", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-14T15:58:16", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}